# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SCS Softwares — frontend environment variables (Vite)
#
# Copy to `.env.local` for local development. Placeholders only — never commit
# real values. Only variables prefixed with VITE_ are exposed to the browser,
# so ONLY public/publishable values belong here.
#
# NEVER put server-side secrets in this file or any VITE_ variable:
# no Claude/Anthropic API keys, no Resend keys, no Supabase service-role key,
# no Turnstile secret key. Those belong in a backend/serverless environment
# (added in a later step), not in the frontend.
#
# All variables are OPTIONAL — the site currently works without any of them.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Google Analytics 4 measurement ID (public), e.g. G-XXXXXXXXXX
VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=

# WhatsApp contact number in international format without "+", e.g. 9170000000xx
VITE_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=

# Cal.com scheduling URL, e.g. https://cal.com/your-team/intro-call
VITE_CALCOM_URL=

# Supabase project URL (public), e.g. https://xxxxxxxx.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=

# Supabase anon/publishable key (public; NOT the service-role key)
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Cloudflare Turnstile SITE key (public; NOT the secret key)
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Buddy voice agent (real-time voice consultation)
#
# The voice feature needs NO new frontend variables — it reuses
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL, VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY and VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY above.
#
# All voice secrets are SERVER-SIDE ONLY (never VITE_*):
#   Supabase Edge Function secrets: LIVEKIT_URL, LIVEKIT_API_KEY,
#     LIVEKIT_API_SECRET, TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY, ALLOWED_ORIGINS,
#     RATE_LIMIT_SALT, VOICE_AGENT_ENABLED, VOICE_RATE_LIMITS,
#     VOICE_AGENT_SECRET, RESEND_API_KEY, LEAD_ADMIN_EMAIL,
#     EMAIL_FROM_ADDRESS, PUBLIC_SITE_URL
#   Agent worker env (agent/.env.example): GOOGLE_API_KEY (Gemini — the ONLY
#     reasoning provider), OPENAI_API_KEY (speech-to-text ONLY, opt-in),
#     ELEVENLABS_API_KEY (text-to-speech), LiveKit credentials,
#     VOICE_AGENT_SECRET and session limits.
# See docs/BUDDY_VOICE_AGENT_SETUP.md for the full setup guide.
#
# The Project Analysis document extract/analyze feature (ai-estimate Edge
# Function) also uses a server-side-only GOOGLE_API_KEY Supabase secret —
# never a VITE_* variable. See supabase/functions/ai-estimate/index.ts.
#
# COMMERCIAL POLICY: every client-facing rate, capacity, budget-fit percentage
# and optional-upgrade band comes from src/policy/estimationPolicy.ts (mirrored
# into supabase/functions/_shared/ and agent/src/). There is deliberately NO
# environment variable for any of them — a rate is a business decision that
# belongs in version control with its tests, not in a deploy config.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
